## Interface: 20506
## Title: Netrac (Nebster Tracking)
## Notes: Nebster Tracking: trainer trips window, XP/kills/gold/loot/deaths/dungeon tracking, quest XP in the quest log. Writes a snapshot of your character (level, stats, gear, quests, level-up history) to SavedVariables so it can be read outside the game. Read-only, no network.
## Author: Lukas
## Version: 0.3
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: NEB_CharLogDB, NEB_TrainerDB

